### Capture Requirements
- Total capture threshold = total battalion health for all armies * 0.75
- Battalion must be within attack range to deal damage
- Damage dealt contributes to side's control progress
- Target must be neutral node (3, 4, 5)

### Control Progress
// Implementation of:
// - @battle-performance-standards.mdc#State-Updates#Damage-Tracking
// - @battle-core-mechanics.mdc#Combat-Logic#Control-Progress

// Referenced by:
// - @battle-targeting-system.mdc#Combat-Sequence#State-Updates
// - @battle-visual-feedback.mdc#Node-Status#Control-Progress

Capture Mechanics:
- Each side accumulates control through damage dealt
- To capture a node with existing enemy control:
  1. Must deal enough damage to reach total capture threshold
  2. Must also overcome enemy's accumulated control damage
- Example:
  - Capture threshold: 1000 damage (based on total army health)
  - User deals 400 damage
  - Enemy must now deal 1400 damage to capture (1000 + 400)
  - Or user can complete capture with 600 more damage

